Version: 1.0
ProjectId: f24f003b-f6e9-4a3b-8038-c10b5c94bc37

RestoreWorkspace: No
SaveWorkspace: No
AlwaysSaveHistory: No

EnableCodeIndexing: Yes
UseSpacesForTab: Yes
NumSpacesForTab: 2
Encoding: UTF-8

RnwWeave: knitr
LaTeX: XeLaTeX

AutoAppendNewline: Yes
StripTrailingWhitespace: Yes
LineEndingConversion: Posix

BuildType: Package
PackageUseDevtools: Yes
PackageInstallArgs: --no-multiarch --with-keep.source
PackageCheckArgs: --as-cran --no-manual --timings
PackageRoxygenize: rd,collate,namespace
